[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2763273385","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104757#issuecomment-2763273385","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104757","id":2763273385,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ktDSp","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-29T10:09:16Z","updated_at":"2025-03-29T10:09:16Z","body":"This change completely breaks the functionality of this code branch. Take the following example:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar dict: Dictionary[String, Variant] = {\r\n\t\t\"a\": \"h\"\r\n\t}\r\n\tdict[\"a\"].  # At this point the code should try to get the corresponding value, and offer autocompletion for string methods.\r\n```\r\n\r\nWith this changes this does not work anymore, since `r_type` will always be `Nil` at this point. Maybe you meant to check for `index` instead of `r_type`?\r\n\r\nThat aside, I'm not sure whether this is a good approach, since it duplicates logic just to avoid an error message. `Variant::get` used to fail silently and return information on whether the result is valid. So typed dictionaries behave differently than all other variants I'm aware of, is this really necessary @Repiteo ?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2763273385/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764249548","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104757#issuecomment-2764249548","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104757","id":2764249548,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kwxnM","user":{"login":"Andrewyuan34","id":107494519,"node_id":"U_kgDOBmg8dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107494519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34","html_url":"https://github.com/Andrewyuan34","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-29T21:28:55Z","updated_at":"2025-03-29T21:28:55Z","body":"@HolonProduction thx for the suggestion! Already changed the commit.\r\nOne thing I'm curious is why loop variable s retains its unprocessed reduced_value state after parsing. And based on the code example you provided, the reduced_value is modified which meets the expectation.\r\n\r\n\tfunc test_untyped_array() -> void:\r\n\t     var dict: Dictionary[String, int] = {\"a\": 12}\r\n\t     var n: Array = [\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"]\r\n\t     for s in n:\r\n\t\tvar value = dict[s]\r\n\r\nThe reduced_value should be determined after parsing loop variable for typed container, isn't it?\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764249548/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764295470","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104757#issuecomment-2764295470","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104757","id":2764295470,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kw80u","user":{"login":"Andrewyuan34","id":107494519,"node_id":"U_kgDOBmg8dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107494519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34","html_url":"https://github.com/Andrewyuan34","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Andrewyuan34/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public",